    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for modeling temporal dynamics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_dynamics" kindref="compound">Dynamics</ref> represents a generic temporal change for traits or resources. Derived classes must implement specific behavior such as cycles, pulses, or growth rates. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
